      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that a <a href=\"RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> object is typically stateless and thus reusable.",
      "translation": "请注意，<a href=\"RowMapper.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql 中的接口\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> 对象通常是无状态的，因此可以重复使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Useful for the typical case of one object per row in the database table. The number of entries in the results will\nmatch the number of rows.",
      "translation": "适用于数据库表中每行一个对象的典型情况。结果中的条目数量将与行数相匹配。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"ReactiveResultSetExtractor.html#extractData(org.springframework.data.cassandra.ReactiveResultSet)\">ReactiveResultSetExtractor</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"ReactiveResultSetExtractor.html#extractData(org.springframework.data.cassandra.ReactiveResultSet)\">ReactiveResultSetExtractor</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"ReactiveResultSetExtractor.html#extractData(org.springframework.data.cassandra.ReactiveResultSet)\">extractData</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"ReactiveResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\">ReactiveResultSetExtractor</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in ReactiveRowMapperResultSetExtractor\">T</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"ReactiveResultSetExtractor.html#extractData(org.springframework.data.cassandra.ReactiveResultSet)\">extractData</a></code> 接口 <code><a href=\"ReactiveResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\">ReactiveResultSetExtractor</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in ReactiveRowMapperResultSetExtractor\">T</a>&gt;</code> 中的方法",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>rowMapper</code> - the <a href=\"RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> which creates an object for each row, must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>rowMapper</code> - 用于为每一行创建对象的 <a href=\"RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> 接口，不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>resultSet</code> - <a href=\"../../ReactiveResultSet.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>ReactiveResultSet</code></a> to extract data from, must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>resultSet</code> - 用于从中提取数据的<a href=\"../../ReactiveResultSet.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>ReactiveResultSet</code></a>接口，不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>com.datastax.oss.driver.api.core.DriverException</code> - if a <code>DriverException</code> is encountered getting column values or navigating (that is,\n          there's no need to catch <code>DriverException</code>).",
      "translation": "<code>com.datastax.oss.driver.api.core.DriverException</code> - 如果在获取列值或导航时遇到 <code>DriverException</code>（即无需捕获 <code>DriverException</code>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "an arbitrary result object <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个任意的结果对象 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">DataAccessException</a></code> - in case of custom exceptions.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"org.springframework.dao 中的类或接口\">DataAccessException</a></code> - 针对自定义异常的情况。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Adapter implementation of the <a href=\"ReactiveResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>ReactiveResultSetExtractor</code></a> interface that delegates to a <a href=\"RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>RowMapper</code></a>\nwhich is supposed to create an object for each row. Each object is emitted through the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> of this\n<a href=\"ReactiveResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>ReactiveResultSetExtractor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "这是 `<a href=\"ReactiveResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>ReactiveResultSetExtractor</code></a>` 接口的适配器实现，它委托给一个 `<a href=\"RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>RowMapper</code></a>`（该映射器应为每一行创建一个对象）。每个生成的对象都通过此 `<a href=\"ReactiveResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>ReactiveResultSetExtractor</code></a>` 的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a>` 发出。",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
